LAMMPS (19 Nov 2024 - Development - patch_19Nov2024-56-ga78aee5731)
# ---------- Initialize Simulation ---------------------
clear
units           metal
dimension       3
processors      * * *
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p

# ---------- Create Atoms ---------------------
read_data       ../../structures/Cu.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (3.577431 3.577431 3.577431) with tilt (0 0 0)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.001 seconds
replicate       5 5 5
Replication is creating a 5x5x5 = 125 times larger system...
  triclinic box = (0 0 0) to (17.887155 17.887155 17.887155) with tilt (0 0 0)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  500 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.000 seconds

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../../../modal_app/potentials/EAM/Cu_Zhou04.eam.alloy Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../../../../../modal_app/potentials/EAM/Cu_Zhou04.eam.alloy with DATE: 2018-03-30

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 10 check yes

# ---------- Define Settings ---------------------
compute eng all pe/atom
compute eatoms all reduce sum c_eng

# ---------- Run Minimization ---------------------
reset_timestep 0
#fix 1 all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe lx ly lz press pxx pyy pzz c_eatoms
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-10 1.0e-10 100000 100000
